  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building on international human rights standards among the judiciary - Capacity building HR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kapacitetsutveckling om m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter inom internationell lagstiftning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att &#xf6;ka kunskapen om internationell MR          lagstiftning. Ett utbildningsprogram f&#xf6;r domare och &#xe5;klagare,         regeringsrepresentanter och f&#xf6;retr&#xe4;dare f&#xf6;r frivilligorganisationer   som ska skriva rapporter om efterlevnaden av FNs tv&#xe5; resolutioner p&#xe5;  omr&#xe5;det. Projektet inneh&#xe5;ller institutionsst&#xf6;d till Bilgi University  Human Rights Law Center i Istanbul.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to improve the respect for      human rights in the Turkish court system. To comply with EU criteria  Turkey is undergoing legal reforms. Training is needed for Turkey to  be able to implement the laws and comply with the newly ratified UN   resolutions on human rights. This project will focus on raising       awareness on international human rights standards among the judiciary</narrative>
  </description>
